\ COMPILE.SEQ  Defining words, DOES>, VALUE manipulation, vocabularies, FOR.
DECIMAL
: MKARR CREATE CELLS ALLOT DOES> SWAP CELLS + ;
CR .( does: ) 4 MKARR AR  11 0 AR !  22 3 AR !  0 AR @ . 3 AR @ .
CR .( 2const: ) 123456. 2CONSTANT BIG BIG D.
5 VALUE V
: VT 10 !> V V . 3 +!> V V . INCR> V V . DECR> V V . OFF> V V . ON> V V . ;
CR .( values: ) VT
VARIABLE SV 7 SV !
: ST 99 SAVE!> SV SV @ . RESTORE> SV SV @ . ;
CR .( save/restore: ) ST
VOCABULARY TESTVOC
TESTVOC DEFINITIONS : HIDDENW 77 ; FORTH DEFINITIONS
CR .( vocab: ) TESTVOC HIDDENW . FORTH
: F1 3 FOR R@ . NEXT ;
CR .( for-next: ) F1
CR .( defined: ) DEFINED NOSUCHWORD . DROP DEFINED DUP NIP .
DEFER DF : DFA ." a " ; ' DFA IS DF
CR .( defer: ) DF
: ZERO ." zero " ;  : ONE ." one " ;
: T-EXEC: EXEC: ZERO ONE ;
CR .( exec: ) 1 T-EXEC: 0 T-EXEC:
CR .( #: ) 255 0 <# # # # #> TYPE
CR .( .S: ) 1 2 3 .S DROP DROP DROP
CR
